    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bdb7b02ca1e337d057d856",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回想起来，她在正月的时候以『肚子还不饿』\r\n为由拒绝了吃鲷鱼烧，\r\n粉丝感谢祭也提到过自己以前更能吃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "27a8d5bd513c02fb9090f7a3a67588b870c231849b015b8e8c6fe0d95191a169",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
