    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b049d88fc8870358e034dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00b794e0b224c5ef3e681c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们从某个时期开始，\r\n身体能力与竞跑能力会开始急剧提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e1759e891770fd274c06e8b60b5ff27e2a154b6169526db16d741accc9dcd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ccd42f7a8da800b5dbf8720",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这便是她们身为跑步选手的觉醒——\r\n也就是，被称作“本格化”的现象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5a90d81aef964ae5ceff8ee19d6610019a5d9530e166855d7b3e06e4b3cc22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d646bc22893f86a369e1ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎来本格化的赛马娘们，\r\n都会感觉自己的身体蕴含着无穷无尽的可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e9cfe80b21f2b9f7768c9366d22a124b1181bc4f6a40181a3f1f652fdbd227",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451eb71aa7bcf32ef426f9d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们会觉得身体轻盈、无论跑多远多久都不会\r\n疲劳、食欲比起以前也大幅提升……等等等等。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3693e7f347a8ff249fc4803ef99d2b0ddfbcfdb5982b9c95ab7eb7baf0e0f5fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5be6f0ce15220720cfb581bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，她们会为了将能力最大程度地开花结果\r\n而坚持不懈地练习、参加比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e729b7d8847dd01fd32b11ba0d092f480525cc7c74d2162f39580750b608d9a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c428e915f8e8e092f9004aae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，反过来说——\r\n要是觉得身体沉重、无法随心所动，\r\n食欲也逐渐下降的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8e692e1a117cf1f2cd3b66a38026268b799f51cbaa9d4256c59eafb12789bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9848db24a349d4fbd7de83d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，她已经度过了自己的巅峰期，\r\n目前身体能力正在逐渐下滑。\r\n这也是运动员生涯迎来结束的一个标志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94088c77e07aa832aff0f7f7b1981f281aae1c08f9f1c306ea4f5d3b9492fb5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069116.json",
      "json_path": [
